      "content": "oh okay i get that. it's just that it's a really specific pattern, like it's almost on a schedule. it only starts doing it right at 4pm every single afternoon. is there anything like a technical reason why a light would just randomly start flickering at the exact same time every day? like is it a power surge or something?",
